    {
      "entry": 24137,
      "name": "Dark Ranger Marrah",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24137:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:8a608970b729dfeadfcbc7cf",
            "source:d56b72037cff9fac23130233",
            "source:baef0dc7da0e918d8d0dda51",
            "source:d9595749591c9530e007f893",
            "source:6661f48175dc901ce8dae955",
            "source:043bf80a5acdf1d88cc91f89"
          ],
          "text": "Dark Ranger Marrah is the sole survivor of a recon party sent into Utgarde Keep. Exhausted and worried that her wits are failing, she reports that Ingvar's leadership, the vrykul's numbers, and their savage tactics make him the key target. She urges the recovery of their weapons for High Executor Anselm to inspect, recalling how easily they killed her companions. Her greeting is weary and impatient; she has little time for pleasantries.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24137
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 24200,
      "name": "Skarvald the Constructor",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24200:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:3f08bdf1181260c9234eeea8",
            "source:459af08b5e9ee1bef7246789",
            "source:ebcc5e6144b9f8b3580c9fbc",
            "source:6f0dc1cc227c807e434e5653",
            "source:c6b81c4d456a38d6c40025fc",
            "source:f2a77c56c6fe46530c039ab7"
          ],
          "text": "Skarvald's combat lines reveal a tense bond with Dalronn: he calls for him to join an attack, insults him when he falls first, and protests that it is not over when Dalronn dies. If Skarvald falls after Dalronn, he calls it a warrior's death. His taunts also identify Dalronn as a necromancer.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24200
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 24201,
      "name": "Dalronn the Controller",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24201:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f2a77c56c6fe46530c039ab7",
            "source:126cf43aad39244c259e8cfc",
            "source:3f1cf299ded9aff68976855e",
            "source:b1ea2e974fc173088d53b65b",
            "source:1b6250da6da47cf58703c834",
            "source:febb5a099ef6916e68a24ff6"
          ],
          "text": "Dalronn's combat lines show contempt for Skarvald's impulsiveness: he calls him a halfwit for charging in, then an incompetent slug and orders him back to work when he falls. Dalronn's farewell, 'See... you... soon,' points to a close connection between the two. Skarvald's taunt identifies Dalronn as a necromancer.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24201
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
