        "world:creature:23954",
        "world:creature:24201",
        "world:creature:24084",
        "world:creature:24078",
        "world:quest:13205"
      ],
      "text": "You are in Utgarde Keep, a stronghold in the Howling Fjord. Its lords are Prince Keleseth, a San'layn elf prince who commands skeletons, Skarvold and Dalronn, and Ingvar the Plunderer, a fierce vrykul warrior who leads the vrykul forces. Tunneling ghouls and dragonflayers fill it.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 206
      }
    }
  ],
